title: Proxmox Backup Server: Node CPU and Load
agents: proxmox_backup_server_api
catalog: os/storage
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk

description:
 This check monitors the CPU utilization, load average and uptime of a Proxmox
 Backup Server node. Data is collected via the special agent {agent_proxmox_backup_server_api} which
 polls the {/nodes/<node>/status} REST API endpoint.

 The service goes {WARN}/{CRIT} when the CPU utilization exceeds the configured
 levels (default 80/90%). The load average and uptime are shown for information
 and graphed.

discovery:
 One service {PBS Node} is created if node status data is available.
